    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just... the \"help\" part feels like a lie. i've tried everything. therapy, meds, talking... nothing changes the fact that i'm just a mess of bad memories and trauma. it's like trying to fix a glass that's been smashed into dust. you can't really \"navigate\" through being dust. some things just aren't meant to be put back together.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
